        <profileDesc>
            <abstract xml:lang="de"><p resp="#regest">Johann Kessler, Stadtschreiber, meldet dem Landvogt, dass er dessen Schreiben erhalten habe. Er bittet um Nachsicht für die verspätete Antwort, da er wegen eines Friedensbruchs und Geldmangels zuvor verhindert gewesen sei. Er versichert seine treue und gehorsame Haltung.</p></abstract>
            <abstract xml:lang="en" resp="#mt"><p>Johann Kessler, town clerk, reports to the Landvogt that he has received his letter. He asks for leniency for the delayed reply, as he had previously been prevented from doing so because of a breach of the peace and a lack of money. He assures him of his loyal and obedient attitude.</p></abstract>
            <langUsage>
                <language ident="deu">Deutsch</language>
            </langUsage>
